    "name": "Halloween Ghost Marshmallows",
    "description": "Native 16x16 vanilla-style sprite: three puffy ghost marshmallows in an orange pleated paper cup. Each ghost has a rounded dome head, tiny chocolate eye pixels and a wavy scalloped bottom edge. The two back ghosts show notched tails, and the front ghost's three-lobed hem hangs over the cup rim. Grey-green outline, warm whites lit from the upper left, pleat shading on the cup, transparent background.",
